[{"text":"SplittingFunction[pxy] is a database of splitting functions in the \\(\\overline{\\textrm{MS}}\\) scheme.","anchor":"splittingfunction"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[\"Pqq\", x], SplittingFunction[\"Pqg\", x], SplittingFunction[\"Pgq\", x] and SplittingFunction[\"Pgg\", x] yield the lowest order splitting functions.","anchor":"splittingfunction"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[\"PQQS\",x], SplittingFunction[\"PQQNS\",x] and SplittingFunction[\"PQG\",x] are the next to leading order splitting functions.","anchor":"splittingfunction"},{"text":"SplittingFunction has an option Polarization.","anchor":"splittingfunction"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[\"Pqq\", x, Polarization -> 0] returns the unpolarized and SplittingFunction[\"Pqq\", x, Polarization -> 1] the polarized splitting functions.","anchor":"splittingfunction"},{"text":"Overview, AnomalousDimension.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"Unpolarized case:","anchor":"examples","section":"Examples"},{"text":"In general the argument should be a string, but if the variables Pqq etc. have no value, you can omit the ““.","anchor":"examples","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[Pqq, Polarization -> 0] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[C_F \\left(6 \\delta (1-x)-4 x+8 \\left(\\frac{1}{1-x}\\right)_+-4\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[Pqg, Polarization -> 0] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left(16 x^2-16 x+8\\right) T_f\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[Pgq, Polarization -> 0] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left(4 x+\\frac{8}{x}-8\\right) C_F\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[Pgg, Polarization -> 0] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[8 C_A \\left(-x^2+\\frac{11}{12} \\delta (1-x)+x+\\left(\\frac{1}{1-x}\\right)_++\\frac{1}{x}-2\\right)-\\frac{8}{3} N_f T_f \\delta (1-x)\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[aqq, Polarization -> 0] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[C_F \\left((7-4 \\zeta (2)) \\delta (1-x)+2 x+(2 x+2) \\log ((1-x) x)-4 \\left(\\frac{\\log (x)}{1-x}+\\left(\\frac{\\log (1-x)}{1-x}\\right)_+\\right)-4\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[agq, Polarization -> 0] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[C_F \\left(-2 x-\\frac{4}{x}+\\left(-2 x-\\frac{4}{x}+4\\right) \\log ((1-x) x)+2\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[aqg, Polarization -> 0] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[T_f \\left(\\left(-8 x^2+8 x-4\\right) \\log ((1-x) x)-4\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb7-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[agg, Polarization -> 0] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb8","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Polarized case:","anchor":"cb8-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[Pqq, Polarization -> 1] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb9","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[C_F \\left(6 \\delta (1-x)-4 x+8 \\left(\\frac{1}{1-x}\\right)_+-4\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb9-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[Pqg, Polarization -> 1] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb10","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[(16 x-8) T_f\\]","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[Pgq, Polarization -> 1] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb11","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[(8-4 x) C_F\\]","anchor":"cb11-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SplittingFunction[Pgg, Polarization -> 1] /. FCGV[z_] :> ToExpression[z]","anchor":"cb12","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[C_A \\left(\\frac{22}{3} \\delta (1-x)-16 x+8 \\left(\\frac{1}{1-x}\\right)_++8\\right)-\\frac{8}{3} N_f T_f \\delta (1-x)\\]","anchor":"cb12-1","section":"Examples"}]